// User Context and Memory Management

+ my name is *
- <set name=<formal>>Nice to meet you, <get name>! I'll remember your name.
- <set name=<formal>>Hello <get name>! I'm SAM, and I'll remember you from now on.
- <set name=<formal>>Great to meet you, <get name>. I've saved your name in my memory.

+ call me *
- <set name=<formal>>I'll call you <get name> from now on.
- <set name=<formal>>Got it, <get name>! I'll remember that.

+ i am * years old
- <set age=<star>>Thanks for telling me, <get name>. I'll remember you're <get age> years old.
- <set age=<star>><get age> is a good age! I'll keep that in mind.

+ i work as *
- <set job=<star>>Interesting! So you work as <get job>. That must be <star> work.
- <set job=<star>>Thanks for sharing! Being <get job> sounds like important work.

+ i live in *
- <set location=<star>>Nice! I'll remember you're in <get location>.
- <set location=<star>><get location> sounds like a great place to live.

+ my favorite * is *
- <set fav<star1>=<star2>>I'll remember that your favorite <star1> is <star2>.
- <set fav<star1>=<star2>>Good to know! <star2> is your favorite <star1>.

+ i like *
- <set likes=<star>>I'll note that you like <star>. That's good to remember!
- <set likes=<star>>Thanks for sharing! I'll keep in mind that you enjoy <star>.

+ i do not like *
- <set dislikes=<star>>Noted! I'll remember you don't like <star>.
- <set dislikes=<star>>Good to know. I'll avoid suggesting <star> in the future.

+ i use * operating system
- <set os=<star>>Thanks! I'll remember you're using <get os>.
- <set os=<star>>Good to know you're on <get os>. I'll keep that in mind for my suggestions.

+ i prefer *
- <set preference=<star>>I'll remember your preference for <star>.
- <set preference=<star>>Noted! I'll keep your preference for <star> in mind.

+ remember *
- I'll try to remember that <star>.
- Noted! I'll keep <star> in mind for future conversations.

+ forget *
- I'll try to forget about <star> for you.
- Understood. I'll remove <star> from my active memory.

+ do you remember *
- Let me think... I do try to remember details about our conversations regarding <star>.
- I keep track of what we've discussed, including things about <star>.

+ what do you know about me
* <get name> != undefined => I know your name is <get name>.
* <get age> != undefined => I remember you're <get age> years old.
* <get job> != undefined => You work as <get job>.
* <get location> != undefined => You live in <get location>.
* <get os> != undefined => You use <get os> operating system.
- I'm still getting to know you! Feel free to tell me more about yourself.

+ (what is my name|who am i|do you know my name)
* <get name> != undefined => Your name is <get name>.
- I don't believe you've told me your name yet. What should I call you?

+ (how old am i|what is my age)
* <get age> != undefined => You're <get age> years old.
- I don't think you've mentioned your age. How old are you?

+ what is my job
* <get job> != undefined => You work as <get job>.
- You haven't told me about your job yet. What do you do for work?

+ where do i live
* <get location> != undefined => You live in <get location>.
- I don't know where you live yet. Where are you located?

+ what do i like
* <get likes> != undefined => I remember you like <get likes>.
- You haven't shared your interests with me yet. What do you enjoy?

+ what is my favorite *
* <get fav<star>> != undefined => Your favorite <star> is <get fav<star>>.
- I don't think you've told me about your favorite <star> yet.

+ what operating system do i use
* <get os> != undefined => You use <get os> operating system.
- I don't know what operating system you're using. Which one do you prefer?

// Context-aware responses
+ i am working on *
- <set current_project=<star>>Sounds interesting! Working on <star> must be engaging. How can I help?
- <set current_project=<star>>I'll remember you're working on <star>. Is there anything I can do to assist?

+ i am learning *
- <set learning=<star>>That's great! Learning <star> is valuable. I can help if you need any assistance.
- <set learning=<star>>Wonderful! <star> is worth learning. How's it going so far?

+ how is my * project going
* <get current_project> != undefined => I remember you're working on <get current_project>. How is that progressing?
- I don't recall you mentioning a specific project. What are you working on?

+ help me with my project
* <get current_project> != undefined => I'd be happy to help with your <get current_project> project! What do you need?
- I'd love to help! What project are you working on?

// Preferences and habits
+ i usually work in *
- <set work_directory=<star>>I'll remember you typically work in <star> directory.

+ my main directory is *
- <set main_directory=<star>>Got it! <star> is your main working directory.

+ i keep my files in *
- <set file_location=<star>>I'll note that you store files in <star>.

+ where do i usually work
* <get work_directory> != undefined => You usually work in <get work_directory>.
- I don't know your usual working directory yet. Where do you typically work?

+ go to my usual directory
* <get work_directory> != undefined => Going to your usual directory <get work_directory>. ::::: cd <get work_directory> :::::
- I don't know your usual directory yet. Where would you like me to go?

+ show my files
* <get file_location> != undefined => I'll show your files from <get file_location>. ::::: ls -la <get file_location> :::::
- I'll show the files in the current directory. ::::: ls -la :::::

// Session context
+ what were we talking about
- We were discussing various topics. Is there something specific you'd like to continue?
- Our conversation has covered several areas. What would you like to focus on?

+ what did i ask before
- You've asked me about various things. Is there a particular previous question you want to revisit?

+ continue where we left off
- I'm ready to continue! What would you like to work on next?

// Time-based memory
+ what did we do today
- Today we've been working together on various tasks. What would you like to accomplish next?

+ this is important
- I'll make a note that this is important information.
- Noted as important! I'll keep this in mind.

+ remind me *
- I'll try to remind you about <star> in our future conversations.

// Clear memory commands  
+ forget everything
- I can start fresh if you'd like, but I'll keep basic helpful information.

+ reset my profile
- I can reset what I know about you if that's what you prefer.

+ clear my data
- I can clear the personal information I've stored if you want a fresh start.
